// The abyssal tentacle (2026-09-21): an abyssal whip with a kraken tentacle wrapped round it
// (scripts/abyssal_tentacle.rs2). OSRS's stats - slash +90, strength +86 - and the whip's animations
// and styles. Its 25% chance to poison for 4 on a hit is the one every poisoned melee weapon already
// has (player_melee.rs2, pvp_melee.rs2), at the severity dragon dagger (p)'s 4 comes from.
category=weapon_whip
param=stabattack,0
param=slashattack,90
param=crushattack,0
param=strengthbonus,86
param=slashattack_anim,osrs_whip_attack
param=defend_anim,osrs_whip_defend
param=slash_sound,whip
param=specwep,^true
param=sa_energy,500
param=poison_severity,20
param=walk_f_baseanim,osrs_whip_walk
param=walk_b_baseanim,osrs_whip_walk
param=walk_l_baseanim,osrs_whip_walk
param=walk_r_baseanim,osrs_whip_walk
param=running_baseanim,osrs_whip_run
param=ready_baseanim,osrs_human_ready
param=turnonspot_baseanim,osrs_human_turnonspot
